---
import { PROJECTS } from '@/data/projects';
---

<section id="projects" class="section-padding bg-page" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
    <header class="mb-14 lg:mb-20">
      <p class="label-eyebrow mb-3">Case Studies</p>
      <h2 id="projects-heading" class="section-heading mb-4">Selected work</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-secondary text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Each project starts with a business question, uses verified data, and includes the approach, result, and limitations — not just technology badges.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Featured: HR Attrition -->
    <article class="bg-surface-subtle border border-border rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-12 mb-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide bg-accent-amber/10 text-ink mb-3">HR Analytics — Featured</span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-ink mb-2">HR Attrition Analysis</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Predictive analytics using IBM HR data (1,470 records, 35 features, 16% attrition rate). Feature engineering produced 47 variables; XGBoost with Optuna tuning achieved ROC-AUC 0.91. SHAP explainability reveals compensation, tenure, and satisfaction as top drivers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted bg-white border border-border rounded-md px-2 py-0.5">IBM HR Dataset</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted bg-white border border-border rounded-md px-2 py-0.5">1,470 records</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted bg-white border border-border rounded-md px-2 py-0.5">XGBoost</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted bg-white border border-border rounded-md px-2 py-0.5">SHAP / Optuna</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted bg-white border border-border rounded-md px-2 py-0.5">ROC-AUC 0.91</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-xl p-4">
          <span class="block font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink">0.91</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">ROC-AUC (project benchmark)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-xl p-4">
          <span class="block font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink">47</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Engineered features</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-xl p-4">
          <span class="block font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink">0.78</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Precision @ top 10%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-border rounded-xl p-4">
          <span class="block font-display text-xl font-bold text-accent-amber">$2.3M</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Estimated annual savings (project-level estimate, not validated client revenue)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <a href="/portfolio/projects/hr-attrition-analysis" class="btn-primary text-sm">Read case study</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Yassi0022/HR-Attrition-Analysis" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary text-sm">View on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Secondary projects -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <article class="card-surface">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-green" aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted">MLOps</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2">California Housing MLOps</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Full MLOps pipeline with automated training, validation, and serving. Benchmark: R² 0.87, API latency 42ms, 94% test coverage.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-ink-muted bg-surface-subtle border border-border rounded px-2 py-0.5">R² 0.87</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-ink-muted bg-surface-subtle border border-border rounded px-2 py-0.5">42ms latency</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/portfolio/projects/california-housing-mlops" class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-green hover:underline">Read case study →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card-surface">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-amber" aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted">Full Stack</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2">HobbyBuddy</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Social matching platform with personality-based recommendations. Benchmark: 87ms p95 API response, 99.9% uptime.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-ink-muted bg-surface-subtle border border-border rounded px-2 py-0.5">87ms p95</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-ink-muted bg-surface-subtle border border-border rounded px-2 py-0.5">99.9% uptime</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/portfolio/projects/hobbybuddy" class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-green hover:underline">Read case study →</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-surface-subtle border border-border rounded-xl text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <strong class="text-ink">Notes on metrics:</strong> HR Attrition results are from the IBM public dataset; the $2.3M figure is an estimated annual savings based on model predictions, not a verified client outcome. California Housing benchmarks reflect model and API performance on the public dataset. HobbyBuddy metrics reflect project-level benchmarks from a demonstration build. Placeholder demo URLs are not presented as live production systems.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
